    <key>PayloadVersion</key>
    <integer>1</integer>
    <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
    <string>vn.b1steam.locketgold.dns</string>
    <key>PayloadUUID</key>
    <string>E8B7C2A4-3F1D-4A6E-9C5B-7D2A91F04B63</string>
    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
    <string>B1sTeam DNS — LocketGold</string>
    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>B1sTeam DNS — Locket &amp; Firebase đi qua DoH riệng của bạn (https://doh.b1s.id.vn/&lt;token của bạn&gt;). Chặn quảng cáo/telemetry, fallback 1.1.1.1 khi rảnh. Web/app khác giữ DNS gốc. DoH là bổ trợ — Shadowrocket MITM là đường chính cho LocketGold.</string>
    <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
    <string>B1sTeam — b1s.id.vn</string>
    <key>PayloadRemovalDisallowed</key>
    <false/>
    <key>PayloadContent</key>
    <array>
      <dict>
        <key>PayloadType</key>
        <string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
        <key>PayloadVersion</key>
        <integer>1</integer>
        <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
        <string>vn.b1steam.locketgold.mmb.dns</string>
        <key>PayloadUUID</key>
        <string>D6E1C9A2-5B4F-4E3D-9A7C-18F24B6D05E3</string>
        <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
        <string>B1sTeam DNS — LocketGold</string>
        <key>PayloadDescription</key>
        <string>B1sTeam DNS — Locket &amp; Firebase qua DoH. Token của bạn được tạo khi đăng ký trên b1s.id.vn/dns. DoH là bổ trợ cho quảng cáo — Shadowrocket là đường chính để unlock Gold.</string>
        <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
        <string>B1sTeam — b1s.id.vn</string>
        <key>DNSSettings</key>
        <dict>
          <key>DNSProtocol</key>
          <string>HTTPS</string>
          <key>ServerURL</key>
          <string>https://doh.b1s.id.vn/&lt;token của bạn&gt;</string>
          <key>SupplementalMatchDomains</key>
          <array>
            <string>locketcamera.com</string>
            <string>cdn.locketcamera.com</string>
            <string>public.locketcamera.com</string>
            <string>locket.camera</string>
            <string>firebaseremoteconfig.googleapis.com</string>
            <string>firebaseremoteconfig.google.com</string>
            <string>us-central1-locket-4252a.cloudfunctions.net</string>
          </array>
        </dict>
        <key>ProhibitDisablement</key>
        <false/>
      </dict>
